# Enforce LF line endings for all text files on checkout, regardless of platform.
# Without this, a Windows runner's `git checkout` (autocrlf) can convert LF -> CRLF on disk, and a
# formatter/linter configured for LF then reports every file as differing — failing the Windows CI gate.
# Git auto-detects binary files and leaves them untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
